&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;ul&gt;
     &lt;li&gt;
     &lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:14px"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;57 grams of cocaine&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:arial nova,arial nova_embeddedfont,arial nova_msfontservice,sans-serif; font-size:14px"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
     &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class="OutlineElement Ltr SCXW182284300 BCX0" style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; -webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; overflow: visible; cursor: text; clear: both; position: relative; direction: ltr; font-family: &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Web&amp;quot;, Arial, Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:14px"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:arial nova,arial nova_embeddedfont,arial nova_msfontservice,sans-serif"&gt;The case involves criminal activity in both Salem and the Portland area. On Thursday, November 13, Salem Police SWAT, with support from the Oregon State Police SWAT Team, served search warrants at two Salem residences &mdash; one in the &lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;3300 block of Hadley Street NE&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:arial nova,arial nova_embeddedfont,arial nova_msfontservice,sans-serif"&gt; and another in the &lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;500 block of Taybin Road NW&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:arial nova,arial nova_embeddedfont,arial nova_msfontservice,sans-serif"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:arial nova,arial nova_embeddedfont,arial nova_msfontservice,sans-serif"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class="OutlineElement Ltr SCXW182284300 BCX0" style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; -webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; overflow: visible; cursor: text; clear: both; position: relative; direction: ltr; font-family: &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Web&amp;quot;, Arial, Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:14px"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:arial nova,arial nova_embeddedfont,arial nova_msfontservice,sans-serif"&gt;Three individuals were arrested in connection with the case: &lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cesar Daniel Arevalo, 36, of Salem; Jose Luis Diaz-Ceballos, 24; and Jose Luis Brown-Ceballos, 35&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:arial nova,arial nova_embeddedfont,arial nova_msfontservice,sans-serif"&gt;. All were taken into custody and made their initial appearances in federal court in Portland earlier this week. The case is being prosecuted by the U.S. Attorney&rsquo;s Office for the District of Oregon.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:arial nova,arial nova_embeddedfont,arial nova_msfontservice,sans-serif"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class="OutlineElement Ltr SCXW182284300 BCX0" style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; -webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; overflow: visible; cursor: text; clear: both; position: relative; direction: ltr; font-family: &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Web&amp;quot;, Arial, Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:14px"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:arial nova,arial nova_embeddedfont,arial nova_msfontservice,sans-serif"&gt;&ldquo;This case exemplifies proactive policing as opposed to reactive policing,&rdquo; said Salem Police Chief Trevor Womack. &ldquo;It reflects our strategic focus on violence reduction and the importance of strong partnerships in addressing gun crime. While both fatal and non-fatal injury shootings are down this year compared to the same period last year, we recognize more work is needed to reverse the longer-term trendline.&rdquo;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:arial nova,arial nova_embeddedfont,arial nova_msfontservice,sans-serif"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;

