&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:14px"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:arial nova light,arial nova light_embeddedfont,arial nova light_msfontservice,sans-serif"&gt;Patrol officers responded promptly and took the student into custody without incident. The 17-year-old male from Salem was lodged at the Marion County Juvenile Detention Center on a charge of Unlawful Possession of a Firearm.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:arial nova light,arial nova light_embeddedfont,arial nova light_msfontservice,sans-serif"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
