&lt;div style="font-family: &amp;quot;Optimistic 95&amp;quot;, system-ui, sans-serif; color: rgb(28, 43, 51); font-size: 14px; white-space-collapse: preserve; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"&gt;
&lt;div class="_1mf _1mj" style="position: relative; direction: ltr; font-family: inherit;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:inherit"&gt;At 1:30 p.m., deputies responded to a report of a physical dispute in the area of Clear Lake Road and Green Hill Road, west of Eugene. Deputies contacted the involved and determined the driver, Lisa Jean Fox, 62, of Deadwood, had assaulted the victim. Deputies also observed Fox was impaired. After additional investigation, Fox was arrested for DUII, Assault in the 4th Degree, and Menacing. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
