&lt;div class="_1mf _1mj" style="position: relative; direction: ltr; font-family: inherit;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:inherit; white-space-collapse:preserve"&gt;UPDATE - 12/11/25 - Rescued&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class="_1mf _1mj" style="position: relative; direction: ltr; font-family: inherit;"&gt;&lt;br /&gt;
The missing mushroom picker, Erik &lt;span style="background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255); color:rgb(28, 43, 51); font-family:optimistic 95,system-ui,sans-serif; font-size:14px"&gt;Aguilar-Cisneros, was found alive in the Hadsall Creek area by Search &amp;amp; Rescue this afternoon and transported to an area hospital for treatment related to hypothermia. More details to follow. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class="_1mf _1mj" style="position: relative; direction: ltr; font-family: inherit;"&gt;&lt;br /&gt;
--&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class="_1mf _1mj" style="position: relative; direction: ltr; font-family: inherit;"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
