&lt;div class="_1mf _1mj" style="position: relative; direction: ltr; font-family: inherit;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:inherit"&gt;As our community continues to engage in conversation regarding this technology, the Sheriff&rsquo;s Office will work with our residents and partner agencies to identify modern law enforcement tools and practices that meet our high standards of local control and privacy. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
